# Local provider credentials for `npm run eval` (gitignored — never commit real keys).
# pi reads provider API keys from the environment; set the one(s) for your provider:
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
#
# Already authenticated via `pi` /login (OAuth, stored in ~/.pi/agent/auth.json)?
# You don't need anything here — the harness uses that automatically.
